{"metadata": {"team_id": "TREMA_UNH", "run_id": "run_6-task-2", "topic_id": "msmarco_v2.1_doc_48_273997000", "type": "automatic", "use_starter_kit": 1}, "responses": [{"text": "Citibank wired $900 million in what they claimed was a 'clerical error' to lenders of Revlon, controlled by billionaire Ron Perelman.", "citations": ["msmarco_v2.1_doc_35_1305699748#7_3038467473"]}, {"text": "Citibank has launched an internal investigation into the matter after the $900 million payment was discovered.", "citations": ["msmarco_v2.1_doc_35_1305699748#7_3038467473"]}, {"text": "Several hedge funds, including Brigade Capital Management, Symphony Asset Management and HPS Investment Partners, are refusing to hand back the $900 million, despite Citibank's claims that it was an error.", "citations": ["msmarco_v2.1_doc_35_1305699748#7_3038467473"]}, {"text": "Citibank is facing a lawsuit from these lenders who claim Revlon shifted intellectual property rights backing their loan into new debt collateral.", "citations": ["msmarco_v2.1_doc_35_1305699748#7_3038467473"]}, {"text": "Citibank's internal investigation is ongoing, indicating they are taking the matter seriously and supporting their claim of a clerical error.", "citations": ["msmarco_v2.1_doc_35_1305699748#7_3038467473"]}]}
{"metadata": {"team_id": "TREMA_UNH", "run_id": "run_6-task-2", "topic_id": "msmarco_v2.1_doc_48_515083157", "type": "automatic", "use_starter_kit": 1}, "responses": [{"text": "NASA scientists claim to have discovered evidence of a parallel universe where time moves backwards.", "citations": ["msmarco_v2.1_doc_36_819561425#7_1610053245", "msmarco_v2.1_doc_36_819561425#9_1610057190"]}, {"text": "The ANITA experiment has found particles that may be from outside our universe, suggesting a parallel universe with reverse physics.", "citations": ["msmarco_v2.1_doc_36_819561425#9_1610057190"]}, {"text": "Peter Gorham, a physics professor at the University of Hawaii, suggested that signals came from upward-moving particles tunneling through the Earth before erupting from the ice.", "citations": ["msmarco_v2.1_doc_36_819561425#9_1610057190"]}, {"text": "While some scientists are convinced by these findings, others believe alternative explanations such as updated models about Antarctic ice could account for ANITA's detections.", "citations": ["msmarco_v2.1_doc_36_819561425#9_1610057190", "msmarco_v2.1_doc_56_895284034#6_1839017546"]}]}
